[4361]="700400A8\n1\tSpeak to Beriaudur and start the training exercise\tThe city watch of Dol Amroth is performing a training exercise in which they wish you to participate. Once accepted, this quest cannot be cancelled. You must complete the training exercise to finish the quest.\n",
[4362]="700411C9\n1\tSpeak with Ransroth\tTalk to Ransroth\n",
[4363]="70040A12\n1\tTalk to Beriaudur\tYou have received a summons asking you to report to Beriaudur in Dol Amroth.\n2\tTalk to Beriaudur\tBeriaudur can be found in Dol Amroth. Beriaudur, head of the Dol Amroth city guard, is looking forward to speaking with you.\n",
[4364]="70040E63\n1\tDeliver the damaged furs to a collection box\030Collect damaged furs (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire damaged furs.\n",
[4365]="70040E60\n1\tDeliver the glinting dust piles to a collection box\030Collect glinting dust piles (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire glinting dust piles.\n",
