[4369]="70040E5F\n1\tDeliver the toxic filth to a collection box\030Collect toxic filth (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire toxic filth.\n",
[4370]="70043A9D\n1\tTalk to JWBarry\tBy completing this quest, you will receive all Dol Amroth endgame deeds for a high level character.\n",
[4371]="70054B0B\n1\tDefeat Mordor dread-archers\tMordor dread-archers can be found at Dol Naeg. You should defeat Mordor dread-archers.\n2\tDefeat Mordor dread-archers at Dol Naeg (total: 6)\tMordor dread-archers can be found at Dol Naeg. You should defeat Mordor dread-archers.\n3\tCompleted\tDefeated many Mordor dread-archers at Dol Naeg.\n",
[4372]="7002C60F\n1\tRescue Dolmund\tYou should find Armund's brother Dolmund and help him get back to the mill. Armund said that Dolmund headed west to clear debris from upriver to keep it from fouling the sawmill's wheel.\n2\tTalk to Dolmund\tYou should speak with Dolmund at the Limlight Gorge sawmill.\n",
[4373]="70062F62\n1\tTalk to Celebrimbor\tCelebrimbor is leading the defence of Caras Gelebren against the armies of the Enemy. You should talk to Celebrimbor.\n2\tDefend against the first assault\tAfter destroying the lower city, the Enemy has renewed the assault on Caras Gelebren. You must defend against the first assault and allow Celebrimbor to prepare the final defences of the House of the Mírdain. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tDefend against the second assault\tThe first assault has been broken, but the forces of the Enemy continue to advance upon Caras Gelebren. You must hold fast against the second assault. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n4\tDefend against the third assault\tThe second assault has been broken, but the forces of the Enemy continue to advance upon Caras Gelebren. You must hold fast against the third assault. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n5\tTalk to Faeldor\tFaeldor can be found at the northern gates of Caras Gelebren. You have successfully defended against the third assault on Caras Gelebren, but the forces of the Enemy vastly outnumber you. You should talk to Faeldor.\n6\tTalk to Celebrimbor\tCelebrimbor can be found at the House of the Mírdain at the easternmost reaches of Caras Gelebren. Faeldor has asked you to tell Celebrimbor that the forces of the Enemy will soon breach the inner gates of Caras Gelebren. You should talk to Celebrimbor.\n7\tDefend against the fourth assault\tThe Enemy has breached the southern gates of Caras Gelebren. You must hold fast against the fourth assault and aid Celebrimbor in the defence of the House of the Mírdain. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n8\tDefend against the final assault\tThe Enemy has overrun the gates of Caras Gelebren. You must hold fast against the final assault and aid Celebrimbor in the defence of the House of the Mírdain. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n9\tDefeat the Enemy's champion\tYou have broken the final assault upon Caras Gelebren, but the Enemy has sent one of his champions to ensure the doom of Caras Gelebren. You must defeat the Enemy's champion. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n10\tTalk to Celebrimbor\tThe Enemy's champion has been defeated, but the day is not yet won. You should talk to Celebrimbor.\n11\tDefend Caras Gelebren from the Enemy\tThe forces of the Enemy have overrun the city, and though you have triumphed over one of the Enemy's champion, Caras Gelebren is doomed. You should stand with Celebrimbor against the Enemy.\n",
[4374]="70062EF4\n1\tComplete 'Doom of Caras Gelebren' in a raid group\tCaras Gelebren, the Silver Bastion, was once the capital of Tham Mírdain and the jewel of Eregion. Determined to possess the Great Rings of Power, Sauron made war upon the Elves and led his vast armies to Eregion to lay waste to Caras Gelebren. Aid Lord Celebrimbor and help the Elves of Eregion make their stand against the forces of Sauron!\n",
[4375]="7006AACB\n1\tDiscover the ritual location in Ghâs Hejai\tAfter informing Hênok of what you discovered you have been asked to return to Ghâs Hejai in Dil-irmíz.\n2\tDefeat Khadimâl and stop the Hakâri ritual\tKhadimâl must be stopped before they complete their ritual within Ghâs Hejai in Dil-irmíz.\n3\tReturn to Bôgalekh in Jadambor\tReturn to Bôgalekh in Jadambor in Dil-irmíz and inform them of your triumph over the Hakâri.\n",
[4376]="70037839\n1\tAssess the damage done to the overturned waggon\tDangers await along the road that leads from Edoras to Aldburg. You should deal with any threats as they appear.\n2\tAssess the damage done to the overturned waggon\tDangers await along the road that leads from Edoras to Aldburg. You should deal with any threats as they appear.\n3\tDefeat the unknown Orcs (total: 6)\tDangers await along the road that leads from Edoras to Aldburg. You should deal with any threats as they appear.\n4\tCompleted\tYou have defeated the Orc-attack along the road to Aldburg. The likelihood of another occurring is high, but for now the road is safe.\n",
[4377]="7000719F\n1\tBring the banner to Refr Quicksilver\030Collect a dwarf-banner\tThe ruins of Thandobel lie to the south of Refr Quicksilver in Annunlos. Refr Quicksilver expressed a desire to learn what kind of dwarves would deign to work alongside Orcs and has asked you to go to the ruins of Thandobel and capture one of their banners.\n",
[4378]="7004315A\n1\tVisit the road that runs north from Eregion to the Trollshaws, and remain alert for anything suspicious\tSpalvi is feeling nervous about something, and wanted you to check the road you took from the Trollshaws to Eregion for suspicious signs. The road leaves Gwingris to the south-east before turning north and proceeding into the Trollshaws.\n2\tRemove the axe from the tree\tAn axe is embedded in a tree by the side of the road that leads from Eregion to the Trollshaws.\n3\tBring the threatening axe to Spalvi at Gwingris, in Eregion\tSpalvi is in the ruins of Gwingris, in north-west Eregion. You found an axe embedded in a tree not far from Gwingris, and should bring it to Spalvi.\n4\tTalk to Spalvi on the Hollin Ridge, south-east of Gwingris\tThe Hollin Ridge is to the south-east of Gwingris. Spalvi has asked that you travel with him to the Hollin Ridge, from where you will have a good view of the surrounding lands and should be able to see any Dourhands approaching your position.\n5\tLook into the distance from atop the Hollin Ridge\030Stand near Spalvi on the Hollin Ridge\tSpalvi has asked you to stand near him and look into the distance from the Hollin Ridge to see if you spy any of the Dourhands that pursue you.\n6\tTalk to Spalvi on the Hollin Ridge and climb the mountains in search of Bingo\tSpalvi is waiting to speak with you before you travel to the Redhorn Pass in search of cave entrances that might bring you closer to Bingo.\n7\tTalk to Spalvi at Gwingris, in Eregion\tSpalvi is at the ruins of Gwingris, in Eregion.\n8\tGive the Rothstone to Theodore Gorse in Gwingris\tTheodore Gorse is at the ruins of Gwingris, in Eregion. Spalvi has given you the Rothstone to give to Theodore Gorse, since he has no more loyalty to the Dourhands and does not care to keep their treasure.\n9\tGive the Rothstone to Haley Meadowsweet in Gwingris\tHaley Meadowsweet is at the ruins of Gwingris, in Eregion. Convinced that it was a fake and had no value, Theodore did not wish to take the Rothstone. Perhaps Haley Meadowsweet will feel differently.\n10\tTalk to Spalvi at Gwingris, in Eregion\tSpalvi is at the ruins of Gwingris, in Eregion.\n",
[4379]="7000AB86\n1\tBring the Dourhand crests to Tórth\030Collect Dourhand crests (total: 10)\tThe entrance to Sarnúr is south of Thorin's Hall and west of Noglond in the ruins of Orodost. Tórth has asked you to enter the Dourhand stronghold of Sarnúr and defeat the creatures who dwell there, claiming Dourhand crests as the proof of your valour.\n",
[4380]="7005A993\n1\tFree the captured Dourhands\tCaptured Dourhands can be found at Sadauk-kala in western Máttugard. You should free the captured Dourhands.\n2\tCaptured Dourhands can be found at Sadauk-kala in western Máttugard. You should free the captured Dourhands.\t\n3\tTalk to one of the freed Dourhands\tThe freed Dourhands can be found near Steepset in Máttugard. You should talk to one of the freed Dourhands.\n4\tRecover stolen supplies (total: 10)\tStolen supplies can be found at Sadauk-kala in Máttugard. You should recover the stolen supplies.\n5\tBring the supplies to one of the freed Dourhands\tThe freed Dourhands can be found near Steepset in Máttugard. You should bring the supplies to one of the freed Dourhands.\n",
[4381]="70063044\n1\tFind an empty bucket\tErina has asked you to put out fires at the Hove family farm. You should look for a bucket at Scurloc farm with which to fill with water in order to douse the flames. Scurloc farm is in northern Cardolan.\n2\tFill the bucket at Hove Farm\tYou found an empty bucket, but now you need to fill it with water. You should find the pond at the Hove family farm, in northern Cardolan.\n3\tDouse fires (total: 8)\tArmed with a bucket of water, you are now ready to douse the flames burning at the Hove family farm. The farm is in northern Cardolan.\n4\tReturn to Erina\tYou should let Erina know that you have put out many of the fires at Hove Farm. Erina is at Sculoc Farm, in northern Cardolan.\n",
[4382]="70030EF4\n1\tDefeat Mordor Spear-fishers (total: 8)\030Find the first Rohirrim scout\030Find the second Rohirrim scout\030Find the third Rohirrim scout\tSigeric wants you to look for three men dispatched to deal with the Orc situation outside the fishing village to the south-east. He also wants you to slay the Orcs that have sacked the town.\n2\tTalk to Sigeric\tSigeric, the survivor of Garsfeld, can be found in northern Snowbourn.\n",
[4383]="7004CF32\n1\tDefeat Orc-kind in Eryn Lasgalen (total: 12)\tOrcs can be found scattered throughout Eryn Lasgalen. King Thranduil has bade you defeat any Orc-kind you come across.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many Orc-kind in Eryn Lasgalen.\n",
[4384]="70027933\n1\tBang on the door to the watch-tower to summon Murig\tMurig can be found at the watch-tower in Trum Dreng. You should bang on the door to see if Murig will be foolish enough to come down from his eyrie.\n2\tReturn to Elain on the path to the watch-tower\tElain can be found on the hill that leads to the watch-tower, defending against approaching Dragon-clansmen in the plains. You should return to Elain and tell her that the watch-tower has been reclaimed for the Stag-clan.\n",
})
